#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:3
#: 748b54ffe7c54a05b7d888ddc2359c81
msgid "晶体原型构建（Crystal Prototype Builder）"
msgstr "Crystal Prototype Builder"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:5
#: ec536f25fc174eefa1e8e8f7f4ce3a81
msgid "`Group`: `Lattice` | `Class`: `CrystalPrototypeBuilderCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:7
#: 248c849ec3d34aa5bb15aa36c81f048c
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:9
#: df751280af114cbebcd9c0c3fb983a41
msgid ""
"从 `fcc`、`bcc`、`hcp`、`fcc111` "
"等标准晶格原型直接生成晶体结构。选定元素和晶格常数后，程序按模板构造单胞并自动扩胞至目标原子数。这是一张生成器卡（Generator），不需要输入结构。"
msgstr ""
"Generate crystal structures directly from standard lattice prototypes such "
"as `fcc`, `bcc`, `hcp`, and `fcc111`. After you choose an element and "
"lattice constant, the card builds the template cell and can automatically "
"repeat it toward a target atom count. This is a Generator card, so it does "
"not require an input structure."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:11
#: ff73ea6ddcc64fd491c8c14ae7c6981d
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:13
#: 97c17a186bdc42e9b41feafe8aff57d4
msgid "场景：训练集缺少跨晶型的比较样本"
msgstr "Scenario: the training set lacks samples for comparing crystal phases"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:15
#: 71ba024d3fe34096b3be26c34928606f
msgid ""
"你在 fcc Ni 上训练了一个 NEP 模型，fcc 相的弹性、声子都很好。但这个 Ni 体系理论上可能存在 hcp 亚稳相——模型在 hcp "
"相上预测的能量偏高，无法正确给出 fcc/hcp 的能量差。"
msgstr ""
"You trained an NEP model on fcc Ni, and it reproduces the elastic and phonon"
" properties of the fcc phase well. However, Ni may also have a metastable "
"hcp phase. The model overestimates the hcp energy and fails to reproduce the"
" fcc–hcp energy difference."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:17
#: d6efdd47b977498d9818f75b465548b4
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 训练集里只有一种晶型，模型自然偏向它见过的唯一结构。需要把 fcc 和 hcp "
"两种原型的干净结构都加入训练集，让模型有内插依据来比较不同晶型的能量。这些原型结构不需要是真实实验构型——它们作为\"锚点\"帮助模型构造相空间。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** The training set contains only one crystal phase, so the "
"model naturally favors the only structure it has seen. Add clean fcc and hcp"
" prototype structures so the model has reference points from which to learn "
"the relative energies of the two phases. These prototypes need not be "
"experimentally observed configurations; they act as anchors that help the "
"model organize this region of configuration space."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:19
#: 8b19e551c0c64526b94d0efde7445851
msgid "**输入：** 无（生成器卡，不依赖上游结构）"
msgstr ""
"**Input:** None. This Generator card does not depend on an upstream "
"structure."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:21
#: c26479d2d82740549b517f65f80ee41a
msgid "**目标：** 生成 fcc + hcp 两种晶型的 Ni 结构，晶格常数在实验值附近略有扫描"
msgstr ""
"**Goal:** Generate both fcc and hcp Ni structures while scanning the lattice"
" constant over a small range around the experimental value."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:23
#: 8fed51ab0d41457e836d7087a14d5b9e
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:24
#: a76c3130980844dca63f6e1956b0c2d6
msgid "`lattice = \"fcc\"`，`element = \"Ni\"`，`a_range = [3.52, 3.52, 0.05]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:25
#: 5e45a714dde04017aeaba28d351f59fb
msgid "`auto_supercell = true`，`max_atoms = 256`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:26
#: bba41f7f6d8e49468d6571f43458cac3
msgid "再开一张同参数但 `lattice = \"hcp\"` 的卡"
msgstr "Add a second card with the same parameters but set `lattice = \"hcp\"`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:28
#: f4356a036889464eaa4b588422a2eb1d
msgid ""
"**输出：** fcc 和 hcp 两种晶型的 Ni 超胞结构，带 `Proto(fcc,a=...,rep=...)` / "
"`Proto(hcp,a=...,rep=...)` 标签"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** Ni supercells in the fcc and hcp phases, labeled "
"`Proto(fcc,a=...,rep=...)` and `Proto(hcp,a=...,rep=...)`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:30
#: b66f7985c1e34f5cb64e8160664ebfa4
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:31
#: 2fac5c0cc3d646cda8983d879ad1a1d1
msgid "重训后计算 fcc/hcp 能量差，应接近 DFT 参考"
msgstr ""
"After retraining, calculate the fcc–hcp energy difference and compare it "
"with the DFT reference."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:32
#: 4b512a960de64571833a3a7fda5d5126
msgid "检查输出结构原子数和对称性：fcc 应为立方对称，hcp 六角对称"
msgstr ""
"Check the atom count and symmetry of the output structures: fcc should be "
"cubic and hcp should be hexagonal."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:33
#: 79f080b61a784e0a88736db7286bb2d5
msgid ""
"如果输出原子数远小于 `max_atoms`，说明 auto_supercell 找不到合适的扩胞因子——关掉 `auto_supercell`，手动设"
" `Rep`"
msgstr ""
"If the output contains far fewer atoms than `max_atoms`, automatic supercell"
" selection could not find a suitable repetition. Disable `auto_supercell` "
"and set `Rep` manually."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:35
#: 6da9fb76302b4693bb97f7c4af1f054a
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:37
#: 82441a697a724edba22514110b0ff1cc
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:38
#: daa1c45f1d7140feb4fe71038a64fe9f
msgid "训练集缺少某种标准晶型的干净构型"
msgstr "The training set lacks clean configurations of a standard crystal phase."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:39
#: 59f7477e4bc04eb0ae6263dcbcaae812
msgid "需要对比不同晶型的能量（相稳定性）"
msgstr ""
"You need to compare the energies of different phases for a phase-stability "
"study."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:40
#: dbcf2140db9a4d45966db227bc1541a0
msgid "作为后续缺陷/表面/磁性流程的结构工厂起点"
msgstr ""
"You need a structure factory as the starting point for a defect, surface, or"
" magnetic workflow."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:42
#: 968396c23bdd4fef8042edb247f722c3
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:43
#: a17af5a1dea9413e9507c1e5d92bfb23
msgid "已经有充足的真实结构（实验或 DFT 弛豫的），不需要人造原型"
msgstr ""
"You already have enough experimental or DFT-relaxed structures and do not "
"need synthetic prototypes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:44
#: be88a14e7ce44988ace6e2b24405a530
msgid "体系是复杂多相材料，简单晶格原型不能代表实际相"
msgstr ""
"The system is a complex multiphase material that cannot be represented by "
"simple lattice prototypes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:46
#: 92bd0a3ba8034e3f8398789cd49950cb
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:48
#: 6ef3d52784b8411fbcba3483f03de3f2
msgid "Lattice（lattice）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:49
#: d6347c140875440c923780675bc2b21c
msgid "`str`，默认 `'fcc'`。晶格原型类型，支持 `fcc`、`bcc`、`hcp`、`fcc111`。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'fcc'`. Lattice prototype. Supported values are `fcc`, "
"`bcc`, `hcp`, and `fcc111`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: 7da2ac811801445499571c73d2694f3b
msgid "选项"
msgstr "Options"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: 84e9efacc34446bb89df4233654cef47
msgid "含义"
msgstr "Meaning"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: 32e3b3e1bee644af9081befc23ed374c
msgid "什么时候选"
msgstr "When to choose it"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: 23f659a58e744719b5586d1a25ede870
msgid "`fcc`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: cffb9921a1b74225bd5c541b76566f35
msgid "常规面心立方 cubic cell"
msgstr "Conventional face-centered-cubic cell"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: 387cd743283945b7bbb3ef6e00b1b74d
msgid "fcc 体相、合金母相、普通应变或缺陷流程"
msgstr "fcc bulk phases, alloy host lattices, and general strain or defect workflows"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: 3291b9ab982740439dd22779e2e32b41
msgid "`bcc`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: 4e7bd14a2dbd4ed7bc69eaf9e583a570
msgid "常规体心立方 cubic cell"
msgstr "Conventional body-centered-cubic cell"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: 932563a7fd154b54bfb721b516f9ccc5
msgid "bcc 体相、Bain 路径、空位或磁性流程"
msgstr "bcc bulk phases, Bain paths, and vacancy or magnetic workflows"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: 518e302dafa34edf91334853e81200f1
msgid "`hcp`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: c86d624c544b4f6ba458aa4a68b7af9d
msgid "六方密堆结构"
msgstr "Hexagonal close-packed structure"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: 0044980a322c4532b18ca287ea26b266
msgid "hcp 亚稳相、相稳定性对比"
msgstr "hcp metastable phases and phase-stability comparisons"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: a1f84d699bb74159b2c2c8f96a551826
msgid "`fcc111`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: ab70659ad35f42eb877a0596c83ecefe
msgid "第三晶胞方向垂直于 fcc (111) 面的周期 slab-oriented cell"
msgstr ""
"Periodic slab-oriented cell whose third cell vector is normal to the fcc "
"(111) plane"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md
#: 89a4e6fb2f4247928c8a8ff6726d5596
msgid "接 `Strict GSFE Path`，扫 fcc (111) 面内滑移"
msgstr "Use before `Strict GSFE Path` to scan in-plane slip on fcc (111)."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:58
#: b18f41bdea0f4456b75319a19fe04086
msgid ""
"`fcc111` 不是带真空的表面 slab；它仍然是周期 cell，只是把原始 fcc 的 (111) 面转成当前 cell 的 `(001)` "
"面。这样 `Strict GSFE Path` 可以安全地按第三晶胞方向切开上下两半。"
msgstr ""
"`fcc111` is not a surface slab with vacuum. It remains a periodic cell, but "
"the original fcc (111) plane is reoriented to the current cell's `(001)` "
"plane. This lets `Strict GSFE Path` safely divide the structure into upper "
"and lower halves along the third cell direction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:60
#: dee68d19980e4aaba1ae3ef622c25737
msgid "Element（element）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:61
#: 513d10fbc4f64356bc5e320dd2e2f9f2
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Cu'`。元素符号，如 `Cu`、`Ni`、`Si`。对于化合物原型（如 rocksalt），这里只用第一个元素——后续需要用 "
"`Composition Sweep` + `Random Occupancy` 来实现多元素分布。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'Cu'`. Element symbol, such as `Cu`, `Ni`, or `Si`. For "
"compound prototypes such as rocksalt, this card uses only the first element."
" Use `Composition Sweep` followed by `Random Occupancy` to introduce "
"multiple elements."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:63
#: f7b5a4ff3f214026b877432a2006fc14
msgid "A Range（a_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:64
#: c30abb71f3364e0584782965d99daabc
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(3.6, 3.6, 0.1)`。晶格常数 a 的扫描范围，格式 `[最小值, "
"最大值, 步长]`，单位 Å。单点扫描如 `[3.52, 3.52, 0.1]` 产 1 个结构；区间扫描如 `[3.50, 3.60, 0.02]` "
"产 6 个。步长越小结构越多，记得用 `max_outputs` 控制总量。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`, default: `(3.6, 3.6, 0.1)`. Scan range for "
"lattice constant *a*, in Å, expressed as `[minimum, maximum, step]`. A "
"single-point range such as `[3.52, 3.52, 0.1]` produces one structure; "
"`[3.50, 3.60, 0.02]` produces six. Smaller steps produce more structures, so"
" use `max_outputs` to cap the total."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:66
#: f00d98fbdf534017894a0b3af9c94d4f
msgid "C/A（covera）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:67
#: f4e4d70255a149048161ad5a687b7f85
msgid "`float`，默认 1.633。仅 hcp 晶型使用，c/a 轴比，理想值约 1.633。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `1.633`. The *c/a* ratio used only for the hcp prototype. "
"The ideal value is approximately 1.633."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:69
#: ac58c294a1cc48a4908c0e2966e17eff
msgid "Auto Supercell（auto_supercell）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:70
#: 5ffc2d8941d74e04a9e824220bd579c2
msgid "`bool`，默认 true。勾选后程序自动计算扩胞因子以逼近 `Max Atoms`；不勾选则手动通过 `Rep` 指定扩胞倍数。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default: `true`. When enabled, the card chooses repetition factors "
"that approach `Max Atoms`. When disabled, set the repetition factors "
"manually with `Rep`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:72
#: 49b42a7c1b8b4de19697a5b64ed6d3ad
msgid "Max Atoms（max_atoms）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:73
#: 35b5f61029f64e86a5c51e65f3724f66
msgid "`int`，默认 512。目标最大原子数，仅 `auto_supercell` 开启时生效。常规范围 256~512。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `512`. Target maximum atom count, used only when "
"`auto_supercell` is enabled. A typical range is 256–512."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:75
#: 03e3f1632406494495715cf5edf52903
msgid "Rep（rep）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:76
#: 08f5bfad0ca94ab69cc9082f26c86cb7
msgid ""
"`tuple[int, int, int]`，默认 `(4, 4, 4)`。三个方向的扩胞倍数 `[na, nb, nc]`，仅 "
"`auto_supercell` 关闭时生效。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[int, int, int]`, default: `(4, 4, 4)`. Repetition factors `[na, nb, "
"nc]` along the three cell directions, used only when `auto_supercell` is "
"disabled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:78
#: d4c217cd175540a1901b5efe5be5396d
msgid "Max Outputs（max_outputs）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:79
#: b886d64c590c423aafb38854471b3c8a
msgid "`int`，默认 200。这张卡输出结构总数的硬上限，防止 a_range 扫描 + 多晶型组合爆炸。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `200`. Hard cap on the total number of output structures, "
"preventing a lattice-constant scan or multi-prototype workflow from growing "
"unexpectedly large."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:81
#: e423a65b2eaf4df5884f1f804ee5bd89
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:83
#: 11a7018e38704ca1b33c4566880c8af9
msgid "fcc Cu 单点（1 个输出，作为流程起点）"
msgstr "Single-point fcc Cu (1 output; a workflow starting point)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:84
#: fc46109c6ca74701a5a53a1fa066adb3
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CrystalPrototypeBuilderCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"lattice\": \"fcc\",\n"
"    \"element\": \"Cu\",\n"
"    \"a_range\": [3.615, 3.615, 0.1],\n"
"    \"covera\": 1.633,\n"
"    \"auto_supercell\": true,\n"
"    \"max_atoms\": 256,\n"
"    \"rep\": [4, 4, 4],\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 1\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:101
#: c2d8b7325593476db9636dc01fefa7d4
msgid "fcc Cu 晶格扫描（5 个点，覆盖平衡晶格附近）"
msgstr "fcc Cu lattice scan (5 points around the equilibrium lattice constant)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:102
#: 3f377dcd120841c4967e17b474ef0615
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CrystalPrototypeBuilderCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"lattice\": \"fcc\",\n"
"    \"element\": \"Cu\",\n"
"    \"a_range\": [3.55, 3.65, 0.025],\n"
"    \"covera\": 1.633,\n"
"    \"auto_supercell\": true,\n"
"    \"max_atoms\": 256,\n"
"    \"rep\": [4, 4, 4],\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 20\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:119
#: 4452d14cc27e45b89e63af898c3a08fa
msgid "多晶型探索（fcc + hcp，各 5 个点）"
msgstr "Multiple-phase exploration (fcc and hcp, 5 points each)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:120
#: 01759362372f464da7ea4be73c75669d
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CrystalPrototypeBuilderCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"lattice\": \"hcp\",\n"
"    \"element\": \"Ni\",\n"
"    \"a_range\": [3.50, 3.56, 0.015],\n"
"    \"covera\": 1.633,\n"
"    \"auto_supercell\": true,\n"
"    \"max_atoms\": 256,\n"
"    \"rep\": [4, 4, 4],\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 20\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

