msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:157
#: 4982864b9f00440db5e8af957056b124
msgid "`Crystal Prototype Builder` → `Atomic Perturb`：先建原型，再加坐标噪声"
msgstr ""
"`Crystal Prototype Builder` → `Atomic Perturb`: build the prototype, then "
"add coordinate noise."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:158
#: 7c5df9fa4f2a495ea739d80fcc09872f
