"`Crystal Prototype Builder` → `Composition Sweep` → `Random "
"Occupancy`：先生成干净模板，再进行成分修饰"
msgstr ""
"`Crystal Prototype Builder` → `Composition Sweep` → `Random Occupancy`: "
"generate a clean template, then modify its composition."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:159
#: 0207ac636b7b4f1881e007d2095cef01
msgid "`Crystal Prototype Builder` → `Lattice Strain`：先建原型，再做应变扫描"
msgstr ""
"`Crystal Prototype Builder` → `Lattice Strain`: build the prototype, then "
"scan strain states."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:160
#: 3aee45693c124d6d95859cd1abdd7c04
msgid ""
"`Crystal Prototype Builder(fcc111)` → `Strict GSFE Path`：先生成 slab-oriented "
"周期 cell，再扫 fcc (111) 的 GSFE 路径"
msgstr ""
"`Crystal Prototype Builder(fcc111)` → `Strict GSFE Path`: generate a slab-"
"oriented periodic cell, then scan the fcc (111) GSFE path."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:162
#: 1cac0bf9d71b4671931f2442267c0f83
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:164
#: 27bc9824fc914f66987c7569d7255d34
msgid "**输出只有 1 个结构。** a_range 的起点=终点且步长>0 时只产生单点。如果需要扫描，设定不同起点和终点。"
msgstr ""
"**Only one structure is produced.** When the start and end of `a_range` are "
"equal and the step is positive, the range contains a single point. Use "
"different start and end values to perform a scan."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:166
#: 682b7f9ec5df490ea38c9944e4a3f3d9
msgid ""
"**原子数远小于 `max_atoms`。** auto_supercell 的扩胞因子是整数，可能因为单胞原子数多导致最近整数倍已超过 "
"max_atoms。手动关掉 auto_supercell 改 `rep`。"
msgstr ""
"**The atom count is far below `max_atoms`.** Supercell repetition factors "
"must be integers. If the primitive cell already contains many atoms, the "
"next larger repetition may exceed `max_atoms`. Disable `auto_supercell` and "
"set `rep` manually."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:168
#: df6897ddfa734d51b3c5f4e8a6b24ef4
msgid "**hcp 结构不是六角的。** hcp 的 ASE bulk 构造需要正确的 covera。确认 covera 在 1.6 左右。"
msgstr ""
"**The hcp structure is not hexagonal.** ASE's hcp bulk builder requires a "
"sensible `covera` value. Check that `covera` is around 1.6."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:170
#: d5141e97aa364e6d9e4dcb6ed1655c87
msgid ""
"**Strict GSFE Path 报 slab-oriented 错误。** 普通 `fcc` cell 的 `(111)` 面不等于当前 cell"
" 的 `(001)` 面，第三晶胞方向也不垂直于这个面。用 `lattice = \"fcc111\"` 重新生成起点结构，再在 `Strict "
"GSFE Path` 里使用 `plane_hkl = [0, 0, 1]`。"
msgstr ""
"**Strict GSFE Path reports a slab-orientation error.** In a conventional "
"`fcc` cell, the `(111)` plane is not the current cell's `(001)` plane, and "
"the third cell vector is not normal to it. Regenerate the starting structure"
" with `lattice = \"fcc111\"`, then use `plane_hkl = [0, 0, 1]` in `Strict "
"GSFE Path`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/crystal-prototype-builder-card.md:172
